ok - Insert clamps a negative pos to the start
ok - Insert into NIL is just the inserted rope
ok - Insert of NIL leaves the rope unchanged
ok - Insert of NIL into NIL is NIL
ok - Insert: resulting length
ok - Compare equal ropes
ok - Compare less-than
ok - Compare greater-than
ok - Compare: shorter prefix sorts first
ok - Equal
ok - ~Equal
